      "callouts": [
        {
          "type": "tip",
          "text_md": "**Memoriza las tres formas**: go → went → gone, have → had → had, see → saw → seen. Para el pasado simple solo necesitas la segunda (went, had, saw)."
        },
        {
          "type": "common_error",
          "text_md": "**No digas \"I goed\" o \"I seed\"**. La forma correcta es *I went* y *I saw*. Estos verbos no siguen la regla de -ed."
        },
        {
          "type": "warning",
          "text_md": "**Cuidado con \"did\"**: después de *did* o *didn't*, el verbo vuelve a su forma base. *I didn't go* (no *I didn't went*)."
        }
      ],
      "common_errors_es": [
        "Decir \"I goed to the beach\" en lugar de \"I went to the beach\".",
        "Decir \"I didn't went\" en lugar de \"I didn't go\".",
        "Confundir \"saw\" (pasado de ver) con \"seen\" (participio, que se usa con have/has)."
      ]
    }
  ],
